<title>USA: IndeNet unit wins South African contract.</title>
<headline>IndeNet unit wins South African contract.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>IndeNet Inc on Friday said its Enterprise Air-Time Systems Ltd unit won a $1.5 million contract to manage a South African radio station's commercial sales, traffic and billing.</p>
<p>The six-year contract was awarded to Enterprise Air-Time's South African division by KFM, an FM station that serves the Cape region, IndeNet said in a statement.</p>
</text>
